### API FINAPI - Testes Rápidos

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3333/api
@contentType = application/json

### 1️⃣ Criar uma conta de teste
POST {{baseUrl}}/accounts
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "cpf": "12345678901",
  "name": "João Silva"
}

### 2️⃣ Criar segunda conta
POST {{baseUrl}}/accounts
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "cpf": "98765432109",
  "name": "Maria Santos"
}

### 3️⃣ Listar todas as contas
GET {{baseUrl}}/accounts

### 4️⃣ Buscar conta por CPF
GET {{baseUrl}}/accounts/cpf/12345678901

### 5️⃣ Depositar 500 reais
# Substitua o account_id com o ID obtido na resposta anterior
POST {{baseUrl}}/deposit
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "account_id": "REPLACE_WITH_ACCOUNT_ID",
  "amount": 500
}

### 6️⃣ Depositar 300 reais na segunda conta
POST {{baseUrl}}/deposit
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "account_id": "REPLACE_WITH_ACCOUNT_ID_2",
  "amount": 300
}

### 7️⃣ Sacar 150 reais
POST {{baseUrl}}/withdraw
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "account_id": "REPLACE_WITH_ACCOUNT_ID",
  "amount": 150
}

### 8️⃣ Obter saldo
GET {{baseUrl}}/balance/REPLACE_WITH_ACCOUNT_ID

### 9️⃣ Obter extrato completo
GET {{baseUrl}}/statement/REPLACE_WITH_ACCOUNT_ID

### 🔟 Obter extrato com filtro de data
GET {{baseUrl}}/statement/REPLACE_WITH_ACCOUNT_ID?start_date=2024-01-01&end_date=2024-12-31

### 1️⃣1️⃣ Atualizar nome da conta
PUT {{baseUrl}}/accounts/REPLACE_WITH_ACCOUNT_ID
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "name": "Novo Nome da Conta"
}

### 1️⃣2️⃣ Deletar conta
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/accounts/REPLACE_WITH_ACCOUNT_ID

### ❌ Teste erro - Sacar mais que o saldo
POST {{baseUrl}}/withdraw
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "account_id": "REPLACE_WITH_ACCOUNT_ID",
  "amount": 999999
}

### ❌ Teste erro - CPF duplicado
POST {{baseUrl}}/accounts
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "cpf": "12345678901",
  "name": "Outro Nome"
}
